<title>INDONESIA: Indofood 9-mth net edges up.</title>
<headline>Indofood 9-mth net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah, unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net sales				 2,096.26 vs 1,387.93</p>
<p>    Gross profit				655.43 vs   469.02</p>
<p>    Operating profit			  376.83 vs   267.47</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income			    290.79 vs   261.34</p>
<p>    Net profit				  258.59 vs   225.07</p>
<p>    Retained earnings			 699.86 vs   422.02</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)	   169 vs	147</p>
<p>Note : The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Indofood Sukses Makmur, 50.1 percent owned by PT Indocement Tunggal Prakarsa, is the largest noodle maker in Indonesia. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6</p>
</text>
